#: cards:1
msgid ""
"<p>The <strong>Name</strong> is shown in search results and in the Analysis "
"records: build it so it can be read alone, with the kind of device, the "
"maker and the model. E.g. <em>Portable X-ray fluorescence spectrometer, "
"Maker Model X</em>, using the same words as the technique list (« portable "
"X-ray fluorescence »).</p><p>Set <strong>Type</strong> to « preferred terms "
"» for the main name, and to « alternate titles » or « translated titles » "
"for the others, one entry each. <strong>Language</strong> is rarely needed: "
"fill it only for a name written in a language other than English or "
"French.</p>"
msgstr ""

